cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Geminex (formerly Gravitas) in your research, please cite it."
type: software
title: Geminex
version: 4.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
authors:
  - name: Geminex contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/mugenkyou/geminex
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Geminex is a model-agnostic reliability runtime for coding agents. It adds
  inspect-before-edit, requirement tracking, evidence-backed verification,
  quota-aware orchestration, and interruption recovery on compatible hosts
  (initial targets: Gemini models in Antigravity, plus OpenCode).
  GeminexBench provides a reproducible trajectory-level benchmark
  for measuring the reliability impact of the runtime.
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - reliability runtime
  - Antigravity
  - OpenCode
  - agent benchmarking
  - software engineering automation
